[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……よし、スケジュール調整は終わった\r\nあとは書類整理だけか）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgm": "009"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020010,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "あのー、プロデューサー？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030050010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？\r\nどうしたんだ、摩美々",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020020,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "レッスン以外にやることってないんですかぁ？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そう言われてもなぁ……\r\n今日は仕事はないって伝えたはずだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020030,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "えー、何もしないのってー\r\n退屈なんですケドー",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020030",
    "charAnim2Loop": false
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020040,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "アイドルが楽しく仕事できるようにするのが\r\nプロデューサーの役目じゃないんですかぁ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それもそうだが、\r\nこればっかりはどうしようもないな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "他のメンバーはもう帰ったんだし、\r\n暇だったら、摩美々も帰っていいんだぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020050,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "だってー、帰ってもやることないんですよー",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だからといって、俺の近くをうろうろしても\r\n仕事が来るわけじゃないぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020060,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "そうですけどー……、\r\nあー、じゃあこないだ私を探してくれたお礼しようかなぁ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020070,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "あ、プロデューサーのマグカップ、空っぽですねー\r\n私がコーヒー淹れてあげましょうかぁ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、いいのか？\r\nコーヒーは、あっちの棚の奥にあるから──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020080,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……遠いですねー\r\nやっぱりめんどーなんでー、自分で淹れてくださぁい",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……わかったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020090,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "そういえば、今プロデューサーは仕事中ですけどー\r\n急に手が空いたら、何してるんですかぁ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "んー、どうしてもやることがなくなったら\r\nデスク周りの掃除だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020100,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "じゃあ、私が今から掃除してあげましょうかぁ？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは助かるな、ありがとう\r\n雑巾なら給湯室に……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020110,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……雑巾……\r\nなんだか掃除めんどーになってきましたぁ",
    "charAnim2": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020110",
    "charAnim2Loop": false
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020120,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "やっぱりコーヒーを淹れることにしますからぁ\r\nマグカップ借りていきますねー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……結局そうなるのか）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
