  {
    "id": 2005003020130,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "プロデューサー、コーヒー淹れてきましたよー\r\nはい、どうぞー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、ありがとう\r\nいただくよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……って、甘っ！？  ゴホゴホッ\r\nちょっと甘すぎるんじゃないかこれ……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020140,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "あー、すいませーん\r\n砂糖の量、間違えちゃったかもしれないですー",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020140"
  },
  {
    "select": "わざとやったのか？",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "相変わらず\r\nイタズラ好きだな……",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "いや、おいしかったぞ",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020150,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "さぁ、どうでしょうねー？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まったく……\r\n他の人にはこういうことしたら駄目だぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020160,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "じゃあ、プロデューサーには\r\nいっぱいイタズラしていいってことですかぁ？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんでそうなるんだ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020170,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "だってー、他の人にはしちゃダメってことはぁ\r\nプロデューサーは私のイタズラ、独占したいんですよねー？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうは言ってないが……\r\nほどほどなら、まぁ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020180,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "ふふー、\r\nやっぱり優しいんですねー",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020190,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "そんなプロデューサーにはぁ\r\nもう一杯オマケでコーヒーあげちゃいますー",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もう一杯淹れてたのか\r\nって、もしかしてこれも甘くしてあるんじゃ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020200,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "それじゃー、私はこれで、\r\n帰りますねー",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020200",
    "charAnim2Loop": false
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ……結局こっちは甘いのかわからないままか\r\nでも、飲まずに捨てるのも悪いし……",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（とりあえず飲んでみるか）",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……普通のコーヒーだ\r\n一応、ちゃんと淹れてはくれてたんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020210,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "私、悪い子ですからぁ、\r\nイタズラは好きですよー",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まったく、\r\n不必要に砂糖を多く入れるんじゃない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020220,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "砂糖ならたくさんあるからいいじゃないですかぁ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だからといって、\r\n無駄遣いしていいってわけじゃないんだぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "他の人が使う時に無くなったら\r\n困るじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020230,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "仕方ないですねー\r\nじゃあ、今度からは気をつけますねー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（注意したのに\r\nなぜかうれしそうにされてしまった……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020240,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "えー、ほんとですかー？\r\nむせてたように見えましたケド",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、あれは気管に入っただけだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020250,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "そう……なんですかぁ？\r\n一口もらいますねー",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020260,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "…………\r\nあ、意外とおいしいですねー",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え、おいしいってのは冗談だったんだが……\r\nもう一度飲んでみるか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──ブッ！\r\nやっぱり甘すぎるだろ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020270,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "プロデューサー、吹き出すなんて\r\n汚いですよー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "摩美々、これ、本当においしいと思ったのか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003020280,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "そんなわけないじゃないですかぁ\r\n甘すぎて飲めませんー",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500302/2005003020280",
    "charAnim2Loop": false
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……やられた",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
